ghklabs uses the Elephant-Goldfish Model. Before design or implementation work, read `_agents/skills/ghklabs_elephant/SKILL.md`.

Design documents belong in `docs/designs/`. Keep `docs/designs/SITEMAP.md` current when a design is added or its status changes.

Use the installed EGM plugin skills (`egm-brainstorm`, `egm-draft`, `egm-review`) when they are available. Do not simulate a Goldfish review inside the parent session.
